[{"client_msg_id":"dd6195d1-939a-4e2c-9298-7e936ffa3c95","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/temp_web/issues/9\u003e\n元も子もな話ではありますが、本家が動くなら我々がそこに参加するのが良さそうです。","ts":"1632060688.211600","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/temp_web/issues/9|#9 openlab上の辞書登録・削除希望単語入力フォームは閉鎖したほうが良いのでは\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/temp_web/issues/9|#9 openlab上の辞書登録・削除希望単語入力フォームは閉鎖したほうが良いのでは\u003e","text":"「SKK Openlab での開発」を検討するための、一時的なリポジトリです。  \nとのことでdictよりもより適していると考え改めてこちらに投げます。  \n\u003chttp://openlab.ring.gr.jp/skk/dic-ja.html|http://openlab.ring.gr.jp/skk/dic-ja.html\u003e によれば  \nGitHubとopenlab間での辞書の同期は終了し更新はGitHubのみであることが宣言されています。  \n従って辞書の校正依頼の受理はGitHub上でのみ行なうことが自然です。  \nよってopenlab上の辞書登録・削除希望単語入力フォーム \u003chttp://openlab.ring.gr.jp/skk/registdic.cgi|http://openlab.ring.gr.jp/skk/registdic.cgi\u003e は閉鎖し\u003chttp://openlab.ring.gr.jp/skk/dic-ja.html|http://openlab.ring.gr.jp/skk/dic-ja.html\u003e や\u003chttp://openlab.ring.gr.jp/skk/wiki/wiki.cgi?page=FrontPage|http://openlab.ring.gr.jp/skk/wiki/wiki.cgi?page=FrontPage\u003e はフォームではなくGitHubへ誘導したほうが良いと思います。  \nそもそも論ではopenlabを管轄するring server project自体が低調運営不在な感もあるのでopenlab上のコンテンツをGitHubに移したうえでopenlabを完全閉鎖したほうが良いのかもしれません。openlab上のwikiも年単位で動いてなく、リンク切れがチラホラあるようです。","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"2","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/temp_web|skk-dev/temp_web\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1632052695}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jQQwr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C535A3DC-D49B-4C0F-BC65-862F3DDE5F6D","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"僕も同じ意見です。","ts":"1632060146.211300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gGZu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D1C69EDC-BB04-4DF2-B055-8F23C5E9DF61","type":"message","user":"U02269AAADD","text":"readmeに謝辞を残していれば履歴はいらないかなと個人的には思います。","ts":"1632059119.210200","edited":{"user":"U02269AAADD","ts":"1632059128.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nse6X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e863f7c-3b64-4197-9cc9-caaa70f7bc3e","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"リスペクトという意味では引き継いだ方が良い。","ts":"1632054883.206200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"slgWH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"914b51b9-116e-4652-a0e6-666d1de95df9","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"skk-dict/dictは104MBですが、これ履歴引き継ぎます？コード変換するし、フォルダ構造変えたいので履歴遡るのつらいかも。","ts":"1632054860.206000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bS8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9be498a6-fc14-4ba2-911c-8e8a0597c8db","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"みなさんありがとうございます。とりあえずREADMEを置きました。\n\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dict/skk-dict\u003e","ts":"1632052521.205400","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"skk-dict/skk-dict","id":1,"title":"skk-dict/skk-dict","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"13","short":true},{"title":"Last updated","value":"a few seconds ago","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":4,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U9S4G0LJW","U7JL1UKKL","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U2JBf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a049014d-0aa6-4da0-8279-0bcddc7f62cc","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ただ、それこそ付与情報として、送りあり/なし、数値変換する、特殊変換する、とかは全部中を見なくても分るように作るほうがいいかなとは思う。\n中の記述見ればわかるよ、はよくないフォーマットの匂いの元かなと","ts":"1632032309.204900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NSg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"afe0f65f-7acb-4fcc-b26c-958ed4052b4a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"混ぜるのは適切とは思わないけどw","ts":"1632032242.203500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3KPE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f3a869f8-da4e-4ba0-91ef-6fca3d6e27cd","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"全部パースするなら混ぜられるんだよな…","ts":"1632032232.203000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bPE+W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f450d8b4-40c5-4850-b8da-77ff758ab44f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"最後がアルファベットだったら送りあり","ts":"1632032159.202100","edited":{"user":"U03C71D7H","ts":"1632032169.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o//Gq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19ca8330-2363-4774-a62e-253437004865","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"送りありと送りなしの分類はきれいにできるっぽいです","ts":"1632032126.201800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P/KF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"890744a5-5f50-4bdc-bcda-a0eb5afde1df","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"どこまでの表現力があるか次第ではTOMLも適切なフォーマットではないので試さないといけない","ts":"1632032076.201000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":2,"users":["U02269AAADD","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qovU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46B5B6CF-E1EC-4760-A8B9-1AE5B0EB9272","type":"message","user":"U02269AAADD","text":"Tomlの辞書だと、アノテーションとか送り仮名とかはどのように表現することになるのでしょう","ts":"1632032012.200100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j8dAu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dec4c300-0cae-4df5-8f2f-256d5ef0d6eb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Androidそんなに速くないからね","ts":"1632031989.199600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MOdV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ee90008-96ff-4412-a6a5-b815747f0d84","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"SKK  for Androidはバイナリ持ってるらしい","ts":"1632031982.199100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mGkgz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"706cd8fb-e371-4107-9e7e-715bb303281b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なんだかんだ巨大なデータなので、高速に読み込める形式…はっバイナリか…?","ts":"1632031947.198100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fNuc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71c7f5ac-3ac4-48b1-80ae-98c6c2ab9d34","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あまりに変換コストがかかるなら直接は使えないからなー","ts":"1632031908.196900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xszvn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba04e661-2f42-4201-8b51-bf17ebc7aa71","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"それが安心かな、ものによっては生tomll読めますはあってもいいけど、正式にサポートじゃないよ、とか","ts":"1632031884.196200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PbZPB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b15b6fe-94a9-47ff-b215-cea73929aa84","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"と言うか多分ソースを TOML にして、互換性のある辞書を吐いたり新フォーマットの辞書を吐いたり、とかですかね","ts":"1632031849.195100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"10N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40c8e69d-cb06-4e75-a8e9-983eaf39e914","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"確かに互換性を保つなら","ts":"1632031824.194500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TdNiI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"089E866B-3614-415D-A41F-0076755D6FC2","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"concatに自動に直すようにするんだと思ってました","ts":"1632031803.194200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nDVU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c83b581c-07e5-4c82-84b4-78686802c724","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"新フォーマットにしたとき、変換元、変換後、アノテーション、変換リストの区切りは問題なさそうなの選べばいいので(外部の記号)、内部の記号かなと","ts":"1632031794.193800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4D6rj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f3d492e-2e24-4c5d-9a8c-17d9cbc5d128","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"SKK 機能めちゃ多いから私も把握してない機能とか書式ありそうだな…調べておくか","ts":"1632031777.192700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MCj/r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c518ef8d-156e-4220-b133-4750cbaaa9a1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ちなみに最終的なデータに直すとしたら(concat hoge)みたいなのを吐かないといけない…","ts":"1632031775.192500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tbEyZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"484912fc-5a2c-45be-a72f-d4240098186f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"問題になるのは、数値置き換え時の記号とか、送り仮名識別ポイントの記述記号はどうするか、みたいなところ?","ts":"1632031741.190500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vkp/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0cca128-cb3c-4dd7-9cf7-2d9ff62a7934","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まあ skkeleton は対応してくれるだろうからいいとして(何がだ)","ts":"1632031740.190400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fAcGm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f5211ed-4dc6-49d3-ad3f-c1fb1006ff91","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"これの対応を考える場合はフォーマット自体見直さないといけないんですよねぇ (そして見直したフォーマットにソフトを対応させる必要がある)","ts":"1632031715.189200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GQV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4af43a05-4889-4a0b-9041-c1ace1cff938","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"TOMLまともに書いたことないので色々試してみよう","ts":"1632031712.189100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3RCKV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e32268e-3ec3-489b-8559-1e56d2a82405","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"まあ、TOMLは最終的な利用形態ではないので候補を全部リストにしてしまうのもいいのかもしれない","ts":"1632031692.187700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fuihu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20c19618-c3d1-4d97-b2e2-010ec3fa5ada","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"自分がそのへんしないので完全に抜けてた","ts":"1632031613.187200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hBT48"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07ec6a0d-1f12-49c7-b62c-09188fdb0330","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"固有名詞眺めるとこんな例はいくらでも出てくる","ts":"1632031572.186500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9sJl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d8e10fe-38f6-4bd1-9525-748a68f3f28e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"例えばですが「シュタインズゲート」で変換したら `STEINS;GATE` が出てくる辞書が欲しい需要はないでしょうか","ts":"1632031558.186000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WP=Jx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7341bd79-8f03-4938-b5f0-8303977424a6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"(ファイルパスのは、仕様がどうかじゃなくて、ツール側に制限があるかのことです)","ts":"1632031442.184700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EkV3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83f8548d-0847-4dfc-8ba0-920ac8e6c55e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"できないともやもやする…w","ts":"1632031428.184200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eznQK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0e868f2-7f61-4bc4-9bdd-a1b128feabbb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ファイルパスもそうだけど、制限はなければないほうがトラブルがなくていいとは思う、がそれを実現するコストがはねあがるというのはある","ts":"1632031421.183800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q6A4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf53bf2a-c104-46ad-b3dc-e925b036b970","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"個人的には;を注釈の印にしたまんまでもいいと思ってる","ts":"1632031378.183000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vg711"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffb11205-ce5c-4fe0-bfff-20b499ed5eba","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そもそもSKKとしての変換の出力に;含めたい人ってそんなにいます？","ts":"1632031339.182200","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1632031352.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AOcOx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f102598c-50df-4de5-95ec-18f7df435822","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"最終的なアウトプットは既存のSKK辞書フォーマットが出力できることのみ確定","ts":"1632031266.181500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s3n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a429857-438a-4bc3-aa05-23873a8dae70","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"はい。まずは、アーキテクトからで、その上で最適なリポジトリ構成みたいな順番ですかね。","ts":"1632031214.180400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GLZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89F5A275-835B-4C67-B080-D609BA19A81D","type":"message","user":"U02269AAADD","text":"保存形式については、先にどんな規格にするか明確に決めたいですね","ts":"1632031201.180100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iRlL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32ce6a3c-a7ec-44ca-ae86-52daee4f22d3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"TOML フォーマットの辺りとかも議題か","ts":"1632031189.179600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z1E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffd0934f-256a-432c-834c-257736ae34c7","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"モノレポがいいと思いますね。そこらへんもディスカッション作ってオープンに決めていきたい。","ts":"1632031171.178800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ckJLg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58d08985-aec1-4876-be58-9437bff55dc7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"確か monorepo 的な構成にするんでしたっけ。辞書ごとにリポジトリを生やすのではなく。","ts":"1632031132.178000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I5w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ddab9d6-d411-4512-b7d4-532d9e1050ff","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、でも変換フォーマット辞書についてはやることが多い上に需要も高いから大変だな...\n• toml化(あるいは他のフォーマット)への変換ツール作成の件\n• L辞書の適用の件\n• 著作権とライセンス、実体としてL辞書適用はどうなるか論議\nが全部平行に近い速度で動いてほしいレベルにありそう","ts":"1632031132.177900","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1632031266.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wYdx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36c5ba7a-08dc-4661-aaf8-21bfb8f14eed","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"お手頃で機械的に作れて実用性があるのはまずは絵文字の辞書かな…もちろんすでに作ってる人がいるわけだけど。今後辞書が生える場所にまとまって置かれていると便利","ts":"1632031045.175900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"benri","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Erzli"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2e4a5c5-1222-42e5-b44d-6b362051b98a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"TOMLに変換するやつだけでも勢いで作ってしまおうかと思ったけど注釈のフォーマット決まらないと作れない","ts":"1632031041.175800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tF4H1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6B65013A-EAED-42F5-89C0-7A5CBCF8C5FE","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"この手のは怒られてから考えることにしてとにかく作る方がスピード感あって好きだけどこの流れで言うことじゃないですね…はい…慎重に進めるに越したことはないと思います","ts":"1632030993.174000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w4O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9e0d95e-2a66-4d9e-9c86-8806652d62ec","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、安全にやるならLの語彙を必要としない辞書を作ってみつつ、論議を深める(実例がないと厳しそうとも思う)けど\n議論は議論で進めてもいいはずだし、有用でしょうね","ts":"1632030937.172200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s=Ac"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56de7201-359b-4a83-8266-9ec86e9f221a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まずはこちらの主張をまとめよう、と言う段階ですね","ts":"1632030907.170600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U3=xe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f438b12-d799-48dd-a6e4-670250506a96","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"それは、ポシリーをまとめてからでいいと思っています。ふわっとした状態でもっていっても何と回答していいかわからないと思うんで。","ts":"1632030887.169800","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1632030900.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M3vv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"248edea2-ee4a-49cc-99da-039aee51c451","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"L辞書の管理者も巻き込んで議論しないと結論でなさそう。我々が「GVL v2 は適用できないので継承しません」と主張して勝手に作業を進めても、あとで揉めそうだし","ts":"1632030828.168600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U02269AAADD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bKPW/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"601db617-afdc-4017-be61-cbe03f35c24d","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"辞書を作るなら、やはりまずはL辞書ベースになるでしょうね。\nで、L辞書は GPL v2 で配布されているんですが、そもそも GPL v2 を適用できるの? という話があります。","ts":"1632030704.166600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qya"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45698669-0a6f-4dae-83e2-39405332201c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"たぶん作られても専用辞書系だと思いますね\nallative Large jisyo は厳しいし意味がほとんどないだろうし(あってもそれもLと併用になるだろうから)","ts":"1632030581.165400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Q+n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c22e78c5-fb62-4ed4-8f31-510875a33c47","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"わたしもディスカッションにコメントしてみました","ts":"1632030281.164100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qhBL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c787620d-1502-4382-a489-a425cb74f71f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"+で使う辞書とかならわかる","ts":"1632030274.163800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ftt+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce3f3d6a-b87c-47eb-b23f-08f1b9e3feab","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"それを捨ててまでやりたいというのはちょっと理解できないですね、申し訳ないですが","ts":"1632030246.162800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UJp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2823a599-b425-4f02-aa6c-376a55a9e44d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"それするならOpenLabのLでいいやってなっちゃうなー、十分機能するし","ts":"1632030219.162000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oc8W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb1fd147-fa89-4b52-aca0-4fe6b0c055f3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ゼロから作る場合は膨大なマンパワー with 情熱が必要になりそう","ts":"1632030131.161300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ugtXM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d8441db-0529-45f2-9a2a-c99253b62a79","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そこは「よし、この辞書つくりたい」にならないとかもですね...","ts":"1632029978.160900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f9rtn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"551bd1bf-de6f-4a2c-961f-a70fe821e788","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ライセンスも大事ですけど、そもそもどうやって辞書を作っていくかとかってビジョンあるんですかね? 完全にゼロベースだと労力がはんぱない上にしばらくは使い物にならなそうだし、何かをベースにするなら当てがほしい。何を当てにするかはライセンスの話にも関わってきそう","ts":"1632029942.160400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/mc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DA37831D-658E-4FF9-B5FB-A17E65D749D6","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"コメントつくの早い","ts":"1632028436.158500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sokudo","count":2,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l0X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B39F01FA-7057-4231-807C-2AD8DF8B0283","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"普通に勉強になるなあ…","ts":"1632028113.158000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6rT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96bf9843-424e-48d1-8877-42b2fd609c01","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"初めて使ったので使い方があっているのか不明なのですがとりあえず、ディスカッションを作成してみました。\n\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dict/skk-dict/discussions/1\u003e","ts":"1632027607.157700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"77bbQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db265a55-88c8-424f-8745-171789dbd237","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自分で1から作るならいいんだけど、先に出したやつは元ソースもあるし派生プロダクトになるしがあるのがね\nそして自分から1からならそれでもまあいいけど、別のトラブル防止が必要になるか?がちょっと気になるかな\n(でも大体はCC0でいいだろうとも思うけど)","ts":"1632026699.152900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U02269AAADD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KdNK/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C88E9F09-7E4F-41BB-8FDA-B700ECE7E475","type":"message","user":"U02269AAADD","text":"辞書に著作権が発生するか議論の余地があるなら、いっそのことCC0とかpublic domain mark使うのどうでしょう(辞書制作側の立場からは著作権の有無によってこの二つのどちらか変わるけど、利用者からはどちらも同じ)\n\u003chttps://creativecommons.org/choose/zero/|https://creativecommons.org/choose/zero/\u003e\n\u003chttps://creativecommons.org/choose/mark/|https://creativecommons.org/choose/mark/\u003e","ts":"1632026594.151100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vmB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed566aba-692f-4847-bff4-ea18dc07361e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あとプログラム関係のドキュメントライセンスとしては\n\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/GNU_Free_Documentation_License\u003e\nもあるか","ts":"1632024357.147200","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: GNU Free Documentation License","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"GNU Free Documentation License","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/GNU_Free_Documentation_License","text":"GNU Free Documentation License （グニュー・フリー・ドキュメンテーション・ライセンス, 略称 GFDL）は、GNUプロジェクトの一環としてフリーソフトウェア財団から配布されているコピーレフトなライセンスの一つである。\n略称として GNU FDL（グニュー・エフディーエル）、GFDL（ジーエフディーエル）などと書かれることもある。GNUはグニューあるいはグヌーと発音する。\n日本語訳では、「GNU フリー文書利用許諾契約書」という語が用いられることがあるが、一般的に「契約」と言えるか否かは、異論も存在する（ライセンス#著作物全般の利用許諾のライセンスを参照）。なお、GNUの公式サイトで使われる日本語訳はGNU自由文書ライセンスである。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/GFDL_Logo.svg/1200px-GFDL_Logo.svg.png","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/GNU_Free_Documentation_License","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/GNU_Free_Documentation_License"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vr8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"890cb523-8503-445e-9b2d-f2df6a311cde","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、そこまで創作性はないだろうとは思います\n絵文字のはどうなんだろな...、まあどっちもライセンスが緩いから問題自体が低いというのもありますね","ts":"1632024293.146700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qWISR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3019F756-DD10-4D58-9848-4D33F0B71913","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"アイマス辞書のテキストファイルの中身を見たけど、著作権を主張するには、創作性が足りないと思いました。まぁ、争いたいわけではないので、特に何か行動するわけではないんですけど。","ts":"1632024195.145000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type"